# Ship and fleet events: hardware, physics, distance. One fires on most days.
# House style: content/STYLE.md.

# --- Fleet-wide -------------------------------------------------------------
card storm_shelter
type event
cat grim
days 5 40
weight 7
cooldown 14
roles A
when cond A ok
text A solar flare is 40 minutes out. Every crew packs into the storm shelter between the water tanks. It's cramped and loud, and {A} has brought cards.
do morale A 3
do var storms 1

card storm_dose
type event
cat grim
days 6 41
weight 6
cooldown 10
roles A
when var storms >= 1
when cond A ok
text {A} runs the dosimeter check. The fleet has taken the radiation of a few dozen chest X-rays so far. {A} writes it down, underlines it, and goes to make coffee.
do trait A curious 1

card comm_delay
type event
cat human
days 18 40
weight 6
once
roles A
when cond A ok
text The signal delay to Earth passes 15 minutes each way. {A} sends a joke to the ground team and spends the next half hour waiting to find out whether it landed. It did.
do morale A 4

card earth_dot
type event
cat wonder
days 14 30
weight 5
once
roles A
when cond A ok
text {A} goes to the window to find Earth and has to look for a while. It's a bright dot now, no brighter than the stars around it. {A} stays until the shift change.
do trait A warm 3

# --- Hardware (controls flavor, never named) ----------------------------------
card scrubber_fault
type event
cat repair
days 2 40
weight 8
cooldown 10
roles A
when res spares >= 1
text The CO₂ scrubber on {A}'s ship throws its fourth fault this week. {A} fixes it, then labels it "temperamental" in permanent marker so the next shift knows.
do res spares -1

card boiloff
type event
cat repair skill
days 8 36
weight 6
once
roles A
when cond A ok
text Methane boil-off on {A}'s ship runs higher than predicted through a long sunward stretch. {A} rolls the ship a few degrees to put the tanks in shade, and boil-off drops by a third. Mission Control asks how. {A} sends a sketch.
do res fuel 2
do morale A 2

# --- Hardware (mechanical flavor) --------------------------------------------
# Twin pattern: the tagged copy lets Diego draw this more often; anyone still can.
card tol_stack
type event
cat repair skill
days 6 36
weight 5
once
roles A
when cond A ok
when !fired tol_stack_m
when res spares >= 1
text A replacement pump won't sit in its mount on {A}'s ship. Every part is in tolerance. Stacked together, they're 1.4 millimeters out. {A} shims it with a washer from the spares kit and writes the stack-up on the bulkhead for the next person.
do res spares -1
do morale A 2

card tol_stack_m
type event
cat repair skill
days 6 36
weight 5
once
roles A
when cond A ok
when tag A mech
when !fired tol_stack
when res spares >= 1
text A replacement pump won't sit in its mount on {A}'s ship. Every part is in tolerance. Stacked together, they're 1.4 millimeters out. {A} shims it with a washer from the spares kit and writes the stack-up on the bulkhead for the next person.
do res spares -1
do morale A 2

card hatch_sun
type event
cat repair skill
days 6 38
weight 5
once
roles A
when cond A ok
text The hatch on {A}'s ship sticks whenever the sunward side warms up. {A} works it out on the back of a checklist: the frame grows a millimeter in the sun and the seal doesn't. One new shim, and the door swings the way it did at Starbase.
do morale A 3

# --- Rescue: CO2 scrubber failure -------------------------------------------
card crisis_air
type event
cat repair
once
days 9 36
weight 6
roles A
when cond A ok
when res spares >= 1
text The CO₂ scrubber on {A}'s ship fails outright. CO₂ is climbing a fraction of a percent an hour. {A} has the backup running in nine minutes, and the backup is already complaining.
do morale A -4
do open rescue_air

card rescue_air
type rescue
cat repair
duration 1
roles A B
default send
when apart B A
when cond B ok
text {A}'s ship is breathing on its backup scrubber. It needs a spare cartridge before the backup gives out.
option send | Send a cartridge | A spare cartridge crosses on the next transfer. {A}'s ship is breathing easy by evening.
  res spares -1
  morale A 4
option bring | {B} brings it over | {B} carries the cartridge across personally and stays to help rebuild the primary. By midnight both scrubbers are running, and {B} is asleep on {A}'s floor.
  res spares -1
  move B A
  bond A B 10
  morale B 3
